# Keep Docker build contexts small.
#
# All service images build with the repository root as their build context
# (docker-compose.yml), but every Dockerfile COPYs only the exact files it
# needs (workspace package.json files, packages/shared/, services/<name>/).
# Everything below must therefore never enter the context: node_modules are
# installed inside the image via `npm ci`, .next is local build output, and
# .env* are secrets — excluding them here also guarantees secrets can never
# leak into a published image layer.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.git
.env
.env.*
.context
cypress/screenshots
cypress/videos
coverage
